    {
      "id": "kinetempo-heel-drop-straight",
      "name": "Heel drop — knee straight",
      "description": "Balls of both feet on the edge of a step, heels free, a hand on the wall or rail for balance. Rise onto your toes on both legs. Shift your weight onto the painful leg, keep that knee fully straight, and lower the heel slowly below the level of the step. Come back up on both legs — never up on the painful one alone. Fifteen drops, three sets, a minute between sets.",
